WEBVTT

00:17:58.411 --> 00:18:00.871
and I'm so glad that, because of its diversity

00:18:00.871 --> 00:18:03.186
and because of its centrality to our lives,

00:18:03.186 --> 00:18:04.899
many more people are coming to it

00:18:04.914 --> 00:18:07.003
as a profession, as a passion,

00:18:07.003 --> 00:18:09.977
and as, very simply, part of their own culture.

00:18:09.977 --> 00:18:11.120
Thank you very much.

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:15.215
(Applause)